    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-001",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(2) The USDA, its representatives, employees, customers and contractors, shall seek to resolve conflicts at the earliest stage possible consistent with laws, and regulations.",
        "keyword": "shall",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-002",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "of the agency or entity must be in attendance or readily accessible to the parties during the proceeding.",
        "keyword": "must",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-003",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(5) Agreement to resolve a conflict shall be voluntary for all parties participating in ADR.",
        "keyword": "shall",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-004",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(7) The use of ADR shall not adversely affect the rights of individuals to seek resolution of their issues through the established complaint, grievance, and appeal systems, provided established time frames in each system are otherwise met.",
        "keyword": "shall",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-005",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(8) No employee shall commit, authorize, or condone any retaliation against any employee or customer because of the pursuit of, or participation in, ADR.",
        "keyword": "shall",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-006",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "(9) Agencies shall make available training and educational services designed to promote effective conflict management. These shall include explanations of available ADR services and employees’ responsibilities relating to ADR participation.",
        "keyword": "shall",
        "mandatory": true,
    },
    {
