        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "The ADR Awareness Program shall be designed to bring Early Intervention Program (EIP) ADR to the attention of all employees and to promote understanding of EIP ADR and its usefulness within the USDA workplace. Each program shall be designed to provide all employees with the",
