        "text": "informal complaints) or civil rights offices (for formal complaints) must first collect certain information via the EEO counselor’s routine limited inquiries. The EEO counselor or office must then provide the ADR unit the following information (a) the complainant’s specific allegations; (b) the names of the agenc",
