    {
        "id": "dr4710_001-req-034",
        "section": "1",
        "section_title": "Content",
        "text": "USDA agencies shall offer mediation to customers to whom they issue an adverse decision relating to agricultural loans, wetlands determinations, compliance with farm programs, including conservation programs, agricultural credit, rural water loans, grazing on National For",
